## About this Project

The **Diabetes Metabolic Model** is an educational project intended to improve the understanding of physiological processes involved in diabetes.

The model combines publicly available physiological knowledge with the author's personal experience of living with diabetes. It presents a simplified systems-oriented view of the interactions between nutrition, glucose regulation, insulin therapy, liver metabolism, stress response, and cardiovascular protection.

This project is intended solely for educational and informational purposes.

